# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings
#
# This repository's primary artefacts are *generated* text files that get
# committed from two different operating systems: you regenerate them on
# Windows, and .github/workflows/build-profile.yml regenerates them daily on
# Linux.  Normalising to LF in the repository means a rebuild only ever shows
# the lines that actually changed, instead of a whole-file diff caused by the
# line-ending convention of whichever machine ran the build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated assets — always LF, never touched by hand.
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf

# Binary: never convert, never diff as text.
*.png binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Diff and review hints
#
# The contribution calendar is ~2,700 generated nodes; a textual diff of it is
# noise in every pull request.  Marking the output as generated collapses it in
# GitHub's diff view and keeps it out of language statistics, while leaving it
# fully tracked and served.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
output/*.svg linguist-generated=true
README.md    linguist-generated=true
